[Mission.Objectives]
Liberate the village of Tourmauville, secure the Odon river crossings, and clear both riverbanks of enemy forces.
[Mission.Description]
In an attempt to halt our advance, the enemy has set up their defences at the Odon river crossings up ahead. We must secure the crossings and eliminate all hostile forces.
[Submission_01.Success]
[Submission_01.Failed]
[Submission_1.Objectives]
The bridge near Tourmauville.
[Submission_1.Description]
A strategic bridge over the Odon river is located to the south of Tourmauville.
[NewSubmission.Success]
[NewSubmission.Failed]
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Another bridge farther to the south.
[Submission_2.Description]
This is another strategic bridge. It should allow us to flank the enemy and launch a rear attack on the defenders of Tourmauville.
[NewSubmission1.Success]
[NewSubmission1.Failed]
[Submission_3.Objectives]
Liberate Tourmauville.
[Submission_3.Description]
The enemy has consolidated their position in Tourmauville, and seized control over the river crossings and other approaches. We must drive the enemy from the village.
[Submission_4.Objectives]
The crossroads.
[Submission_4.Description]
The crossroads and Panthers.
[Submission_1.Success]
Mission accomplished. The Tourmauville crossing has been secured.
[Submission_1.Failed]
Failed to accomplish the task.
[Submission_2.Success]
Task accomplished. Bridge secured.
[Submission_2.Failed]
Failed to accomplish the task.
[Submission_3.Success]
Task accomplished. Tourmauville captured.
[Submission_3.Failed]
Failed to accomplish the task.
[Submission_4.Success]
[Submission_4.Failed]
[Mission.Success]
Mission accomplished.
[Mission.Failed]
Failed to accomplish the task.
